"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) guide.\n"
"- Try an end-to-end example that uses transpiled circuits in the [Ground-state energy estimation of the Heisenberg chain with VQE](/tutorials/spin-chain-vqe) tutorial.\n"
"- See the [Transpile API documentation](https://docs.quantum-computing.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler).\n"
"- Learn [how to transpile circuits](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommandations\">\n"
